[32m+[m[32m// exist on the project — usually because the migration hasn't been run[m
[32m+[m[32m// yet. The raw message is correct but confusing for non-DB operators, so[m
[32m+[m[32m// we rewrite it inline with a concrete fix-it pointer.[m
[32m+[m[32m//[m
[32m+[m[32m// Anything outside this single failure mode passes through unchanged so[m
[32m+[m[32m// real errors keep their original signal.[m
